{"id":70546,"date":"2026-10-23T16:22:46","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:22:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70546"},"modified":"2026-10-23T16:24:54","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:24:54","slug":"caramulo-magic","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/caramulo-magic\/","title":{"rendered":"Caramulo Magic 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Caramulo Magic 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Caramulo Magic 2027<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Caramulo Magic Trail) realiza-se nos dias <strong>20 e 21 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado e domingo), tendo como centro nevr\u00e1lgico e meta de todas as dist\u00e2ncias a <strong>Vila do Caramulo<\/strong> (junto ao Museu do Caramulo), no concelho de <strong>Tondela<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Integrada no calend\u00e1rio nacional de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\">provas de trail em Portugal<\/a> e pontu\u00e1vel para ITRA e UTMB, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o divide-se em dois dias de montanha: no s\u00e1bado (09:00) partem da Vila do Caramulo o <strong>Trail Ultra 47 km<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Longo 32 km<\/strong>, enquanto no domingo se disputam o <strong>Trail Sprint 21 km<\/strong> (09:00, com partida em S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o do Monte) e o <strong>Trail Curto e Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (09:30, com partida na aldeia de Jueus).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos percorrem os trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e cristas gran\u00edticas mais emblem\u00e1ticas da <strong>Serra do Caramulo<\/strong>, atravessando as freguesias do <strong>Guard\u00e3o<\/strong> e de <strong>S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o do Monte<\/strong>, aldeias serranas como <strong>Jueus<\/strong>, <strong>Bezerreira<\/strong>, <strong>Valdasna<\/strong>, <strong>Varzielas<\/strong> e <strong>Viveiros<\/strong>, bem como miradouros naturais como o <strong>Cabe\u00e7o da Neve<\/strong>. Com exig\u00eancia de alta montanha e tempos limite de <strong>10h00<\/strong> (47 km), <strong>8h00<\/strong> (32 km) e <strong>6h00<\/strong> (21 km), a prova decorre em regime de semi-autonomia e inclui abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, medalha de finalista e transferes opcionais de autocarro entre o Museu do Caramulo e as partidas de domingo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Nascido da co-organiza\u00e7\u00e3o entre a <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong> e o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Tondela<\/strong>, o evento afirma-se pelo rigor t\u00e9cnico na sinaliza\u00e7\u00e3o de montanha e pelo compromisso de sustentabilidade ambiental, promovendo a\u00e7\u00f5es de refloresta\u00e7\u00e3o com \u00e1rvores aut\u00f3ctones na regi\u00e3o. Planeia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de pace<\/a> e explora mais desafios no <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-viseu\/\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Viseu<\/a>. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 a 21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=